The '''Royal Consultative Assembly''' is the formal advisory body of [[Qym]]. It is a deliberative assembly that advises the [[King of Qym|King]] on issues regarding his realm. It has the power to propose laws to the [[King of Qym]] and his [[Government of Qym|government]], who can then either approve and enact or reject the proposals. 

